GP-052 step 3 (seat 181490): after „სანტექნიკოსი მჭირდება" (goal 23181), a
new conversation said „სანტექნიკოსი მჭირდება, ჰკითხე ნიკა დამხმარე-ას და
სოფო დამხმარე-ბს." The run saw the repeat („no second goal — this is goal
23181 again"), but the server's case-1 send then opened goal 23200 anyway
(a new conversation has no goal), took the first dative word as the end of
the only name, and sent Nika „და სოფო დამხმარე-ბს." as the question. Sofo
got nothing.

- goalIntent: instructionNames reads a chain of names („X-ს და Y-ს",
  „X-სა და Y-ს", „X-ს, Y-ს და Z-ს", „X and Y"); the question starts after the
  last one; a comma that opens the question is not a second name;
  instructionNeed gives the need said before the verb when no question
  follows.
- instructedAsk: every name must be exactly one saved contact or nothing is
  sent; each is asked; the goal is the thread's, else the open goal the line
  repeats, else a new one.
- chat.service: the owner is told one approved line per person.

